WEBVTT

00:00:05.567 --> 00:00:07.967
TypeWhisper is now on the Mac App Store.

00:00:07.967 --> 00:00:10.500
One download for your Mac and your iPhone.

00:00:15.133 --> 00:00:17.200
With Premium, your iPhone pairs with

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.867
TypeWhisper on your Mac over the local network.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:27.200
Both show the same six-digit code.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.367
Confirm it, and they are paired.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.867
Dictate on your iPhone,

00:00:35.867 --> 00:00:39.733
and your Mac transcribes it with its own speech model.

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:46.833
Your Mac's workflows show up on your iPhone too.

00:00:46.833 --> 00:00:48.933
A quick note turns into a checklist.

00:00:57.967 --> 00:01:01.133
TypeWhisper 1.8 for Mac and 1.2 for iPhone.

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:02.700
Now on the App Store.
